{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>My Cozy Room</i> \u2013 a <strong>relaxing sandbox home design game</strong>, where you can bring your dream spaces to life! Whether it\u2019s a <strong>snug bedroom, stylish living room, modern kitchen, or a playful kids' corner</strong>, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start decorating and bring your <strong>dream cozy room</strong> to life today! \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/704ba91292b9a2012ed0b0acf0b9deb8.poster.avif?t=1752223368\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/704ba91292b9a2012ed0b0acf0b9deb8.webm?t=1752223368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/704ba91292b9a2012ed0b0acf0b9deb8.mp4?t=1752223368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/c7919943defaedaa87189bf166d92fed.avif?t=1752223368\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras_big/c7919943defaedaa87189bf166d92fed.avif?t=1752223368 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>11 unique room shapes and sizes</strong> to design a space that truly reflects your style. Whether you love open, airy layouts or small, cozy nooks, there\u2019s a perfect fit for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/8d7c1e01216bf9f462060e1d2e35a0bf.avif?t=1752223368\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras_big/8d7c1e01216bf9f462060e1d2e35a0bf.avif?t=1752223368 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>elegant furniture</strong> to <strong>adorable decorations</strong>, you\u2019ll find everything you need to craft a space that\u2019s warm, inviting, and uniquely yours. Mix, match, and experiment to create the perfect aesthetic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/96567b39e91ca3d152c72cffe5718cca.poster.avif?t=1752223368\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/96567b39e91ca3d152c72cffe5718cca.webm?t=1752223368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/96567b39e91ca3d152c72cffe5718cca.mp4?t=1752223368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras/93bf831c55e61a8a6b0565cb26e39ece.avif?t=1752223368\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501510/extras_big/93bf831c55e61a8a6b0565cb26e39ece.avif?t=1752223368 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize every detail with <strong>30+ wallpaper and flooring options</strong>! Go for soft pastels, earthy tones, bold patterns, or minimalistic elegance\u2014it\u2019s all up to you!</p><p cla